@* Seemeeu Guesthouse's website (F127.1; three pages since F127.2): home, its rooms with a card and a photo a kind,
   and the stay, with breakfast on the stoep and the beach each beside a photo and how a stay works. Every fact is one
   its agent knows. *@
<MockPage Path="/" Label="Home">
    <MockSection Path="/welcome" Heading="Welcome to Seemeeu">
        <ChildContent>
            <p>A guesthouse five minutes from the beach in Yzerfontein, with breakfast on the stoep every morning.</p>
        </ChildContent>
        <Cards>
            <MockCard Path="/welcome/rooms" Title="Four rooms" Opens="/rooms">
                Each with its own bathroom, one for a family, one for a dog.
            </MockCard>
            <MockCard Path="/welcome/stay" Title="Breakfast and the beach" Opens="/stay">
                Breakfast on the stoep, and the beach a five-minute walk.
            </MockCard>
        </Cards>
    </MockSection>
</MockPage>
<MockPage Path="/rooms" Label="Rooms">
    <MockSection Path="/rooms/choose" Heading="Each with its own bathroom">
        <ChildContent>
            <p>Four rooms, breakfast included.</p>
        </ChildContent>
        <Cards>
            <MockCard Path="/rooms/sea-view" Title="The sea-view doubles" Note="R1,450 a night"
                      Photo="images/showroom/seemeeu-sea-view.webp">Two doubles, looking out to sea.</MockCard>
            <MockCard Path="/rooms/family" Title="The family room" Note="R1,850 a night"
                      Photo="images/showroom/seemeeu-family.webp">
                A double and two singles.
            </MockCard>
            <MockCard Path="/rooms/garden" Title="The garden room" Note="R1,250 a night"
                      Photo="images/showroom/seemeeu-garden.webp">
                A double with its own gate to the fenced garden. Dogs welcome here, R150 a night a dog.
            </MockCard>
        </Cards>
    </MockSection>
</MockPage>
<MockPage Path="/stay" Label="Stay">
    <MockSection Path="/stay/breakfast" Heading="Breakfast on the stoep" Photo="images/showroom/seemeeu-breakfast.webp">
        <p>From 07:30 to 10:00: a full farm breakfast, or yoghurt, fruit and fresh bread.</p>
    </MockSection>
    <MockSection Path="/stay/the-beach" Heading="The beach and around" Photo="images/showroom/seemeeu-beach.webp">
        <p>The beach is a five-minute walk. Sixteen Mile Beach and the harbour are a short drive, and the West Coast
            National Park about twenty minutes away.</p>
    </MockSection>
    <MockSection Path="/stay/staying" Heading="Staying with us">
        <p>Check-in from 14:00, check-out by 10:00. Two nights at least over a weekend from December to February.
            Parking in the yard, and wifi in every room.</p>
    </MockSection>
</MockPage>
